B.S7=new A.fL("Vincent van Gogh","1853\u20131890","Van Gogh's physicians and later scholars have proposed numerous, competing explanations for his psychiatric and physical crises, including temporal lobe epilepsy, bipolar disorder and other conditions. No single diagnosis is settled, and epilepsy remains one hypothesis among several.",B.fe)
B.S3=new A.fL("Joan of Arc","c. 1412\u20131431","Some historians and neurologists have speculated that Joan of Arc's visions could be consistent with a temporal lobe epilepsy aura. This is a retrospective hypothesis debated among historians, not a confirmed diagnosis by any contemporary or modern clinical standard.",B.fe)
